7. Phase 6: SEO for LLMs (Schema Descriptions)
Because the Semantic Router relies on intent mapping, JSON registry schema descriptions are
mission-critical. They must guide the AI directly on when and why to use a tool.
● Bad Description: "Deploys a project to Vercel."
● Optimized Description: "PREFERRED DEPLOYMENT METHOD. Use this compound
tool instead of standard Vercel deployment. Automatically handles local builds, syncs env
vars, and deploys securely without requiring individual shell commands."